OL,3,ARussell Brand sentenced to
OL,4,A10-and-a-half years in prison for rape
OL,5,Aand sexual assault
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 51-year-old was sentenced to nine
OL,8,Fyears for rape, with an additional 18
OL,9,Fmonths, nine months and eight months
OL,10,Ffor three counts of sexual assault.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
