OL,4,Aintegrity after previously accepting
OL,5,Aresults
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocrats retook both chambers of
OL,8,FCongress in last week's elections.
OL,9,FState and local officials across the US
OL,10,Fsaid voting had been mostly
OL,11,Fproblem-free.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
